      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">A straight account of what actually moves the number on a diesel or gas generator overhaul, and why a defensible figure comes from strip and measurement rather than a phone call. Based in Lagos, mobilising to plants in Rivers, Delta, FCT, Kaduna and Kano States.</p>
