<section style="padding:72px 24px 40px;"><div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;"><div class="rich"><p>There is no single price for a generator overhaul in Nigeria, and any page that gives you one is guessing. The same nameplate rating can carry a spread wide enough to wreck a budget line, because scope, the condition found at strip, parts specification and import timing each move the figure independently. A set needing a top end overhaul with the crankshaft left in place sits in a different commercial band from the same set with a scored crank, a cracked head and a seized turbocharger.</p><p>What we can set out plainly is what the number depends on, in the order those items move money, so you can build a realistic budget and interrogate any quotation put in front of you. The table below shows the span of each cost driver rather than a price, because the drivers are what a procurement officer can actually verify. A firm figure follows a plant assessment: inspection and measurement against OEM service limits, then a scope of work and bill of quantities you can price line by line.</p></div></div></section>
<section style="padding:0 24px 56px;"><div style="max-width:920px;margin:0 auto;">
